lue.dismiss()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Otherwise you must perform the dismissal of the paywall."}]}],"name":"onRequestDismiss"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block containing a feature that you wish to paywall. Access to this block is remotely configurable via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/dashboard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". If the paywall is set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non Gated"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the paywall is dismissed or if the user is already paying. If the paywall is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gated"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called only if the user is already paying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or if they begin paying. If no paywall is configured, this gets called immediately. This will not be called in the event of an error."}]}],"name":"feature"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Superwall\/getPaywall(forPlacement:params:paywallOverrides:delegate:)"},{"type":"text","text":" under the hood."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re responsible for the deallocation of this view. If you have a "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" presented somewhere"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you try to present the same "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" elsewhere, you will get a crash."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Warning","style":"warning"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"sym